      "writtenOn": "2023-11-28T20:41:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually--we are already patching the stage list. There\u0027s nothing stopping us from patching `init_lane_masks` to disable lanes. If we did that, then we wouldn\u0027t even need the shenanigans with `repeat_tail` anymore. WDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "d08d6c98_ace2b33d",
      "revId": "566dd5304c1d5eab9afa2d99002be6a828802b80",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
